{"id":"dualshock-3-full","name":"DualShock 3 (SIXAXIS): Full","vendor":"Sony","vid":"0x054C","pid":"0x0268","productString":"PLAYSTATION(R)3 Controller","manufacturerString":"Sony","type":"gamepad","connection":"usb","descriptor":"05010904A1010901A100050919012918150025013500450175019518810205010939150025073500463B016514750495018142750195048103050109300931093209350936093609330934150026FF00350046FF007508950881020600FF09017508953091020600FF0901150026FF0075089531B100C0C0","sixaxisCompatible":true,"notes":"PadForge discussion 476. A DualShock 3 in the form Sony's sixaxis.sys and DsHidMini's SXS mode present on Windows, the form PCSX2's SDL input source and RPCS3 read pressure-sensitive buttons from. Report descriptor from DsHidMini (driver/HID/03_SXS_Col1_Joystick.h, BSD 3-Clause, Benjamin Höglinger-Stelzer): no report IDs, a 12-byte joystick input report, a 48-byte output report and a 49-byte feature report. extendedReport is the native 49-byte DualShock 3 report at the offsets SDL_hidapi_ps3.c, hid-sony.c and RPCS3's ds3_pad_handler.h read, including the twelve pressure bytes at 14-25, the battery at 30 and big-endian 10-bit motion at 41-48. The driver serves it as the report 0 feature reply and derives the joystick input report from it as DsHidMini does. Output report 0 carries sixaxis.sys commands (2 motors, 1 LEDs). The driver folds them into the native output report 0x01 that extendedOutputReport decodes.","buttonMap":[2,1,3,0,6,7,9,8,10,11,12,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1],"triggerButtons":[4,5],"axisMap":{"0x32":"rightStickX","0x35":"rightStickY","0x33":"leftTrigger","0x34":"rightTrigger"},"extendedReport":{"reportId":"0x01","size":49,"alwaysArmed":true,"fields":[{"byte":1,"type":"uint8","semantic":"reserved0","initial":0},{"byte":2,"type":"button-mask","buttons":["Back","LeftStick","RightStick","Start","DPAD_UP","DPAD_RIGHT","DPAD_DOWN","DPAD_LEFT"]},{"byte":3,"type":"button-mask","buttons":["LT_DIGITAL","RT_DIGITAL","LeftBumper","RightBumper","Y","B","A","X"]},{"byte":4,"type":"button-mask","buttons":["Guide"]},{"byte":6,"type":"uint8-axis","semantic":"leftStickX","center":128},{"byte":7,"type":"uint8-axis","semantic":"leftStickY","center":128},{"byte":8,"type":"uint8-axis","semantic":"rightStickX","center":128},{"byte":9,"type":"uint8-axis","semantic":"rightStickY","center":128},{"byte":14,"type":"uint8-pressure","semantic":"pressureDpadUp"},{"byte":15,"type":"uint8-pressure","semantic":"pressureDpadRight"},{"byte":16,"type":"uint8-pressure","semantic":"pressureDpadDown"},{"byte":17,"type":"uint8-pressure","semantic":"pressureDpadLeft"},{"byte":18,"type":"uint8-trigger","semantic":"leftTrigger"},{"byte":19,"type":"uint8-trigger","semantic":"rightTrigger"},{"byte":20,"type":"uint8-pressure","semantic":"pressureLeftBumper"},{"byte":21,"type":"uint8-pressure","semantic":"pressureRightBumper"},{"byte":22,"type":"uint8-pressure","semantic":"pressureY"},{"byte":23,"type":"uint8-pressure","semantic":"pressureB"},{"byte":24,"type":"uint8-pressure","semantic":"pressureA"},{"byte":25,"type":"uint8-pressure","semantic":"pressureX"},{"byte":30,"type":"ds3-battery","semantic":"batteryLevel"},{"byte":41,"type":"uint10-be","semantic":"accelX","center":512,"resolution":113,"sourceResolution":8192},{"byte":43,"type":"uint10-be","semantic":"accelZ","center":512,"resolution":113,"sourceResolution":8192,"invert":true},{"byte":45,"type":"uint10-be","semantic":"accelY","center":512,"resolution":113,"sourceResolution":8192,"invert":true},{"byte":47,"type":"uint10-be","semantic":"gyroYaw","center":512,"resolution":123,"sourceResolution":1440,"invert":true}]},"extendedOutputReport":{"reportId":"0x01","size":49,"fields":[{"byte":2,"type":"uint8","semantic":"rightMotorDuration"},{"byte":3,"type":"uint8","semantic":"rightMotorOn"},{"byte":4,"type":"uint8","semantic":"leftMotorDuration"},{"byte":5,"type":"uint8","semantic":"leftMotorForce"},{"byte":10,"type":"uint8","semantic":"ledBitmap"}]},"layout":{"kind":"gamepad","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DualSh